{"sha": "7e1ac1a6ef399fe994ad17786e18a6e77a6fe9c41e0934bbc068b3c30d140505", "body": ["\\begin{proof}[证明思路]", "将分得的每一份再切成 $k$ 个更小的部分，", "使所取的份数与总份数都乘以 $k$，", "但所取的量保持不变。图示最能说明问题：", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.6]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,1,2} \\draw[omExo] (\\i*2.4,0) rectangle (\\i*2.4+2.4,1.2);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,1} \\fill[omDef!40] (\\i*2.4+0.05,0.05)", "    rectangle (\\i*2.4+2.35,1.15);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (7.2,1.2);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (3.6,-0.15) {$\\frac23$};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=10.5cm]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,5} \\draw[omExo] (\\i*1.2,0) rectangle (\\i*1.2+1.2,1.2);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,3} \\fill[omDef!40] (\\i*1.2+0.05,0.05)", "    rectangle (\\i*1.2+1.15,1.15);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (7.2,1.2);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (3.6,-0.15) {$\\frac46$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $\\frac23 = \\frac46$：将每个三分之一平分为两份，使分子、分母都翻倍，", "阴影部分的大小不变。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[约分]\\label{met:g6:fractions:simplify}", "寻找一个数，它能\\emph{同时}整除分子与分母，", "并将两者都除以这个数。重复此过程，直到不再有公因数为止：", "\\[", "\\frac{12}{18} = \\frac{12 \\div 2}{18 \\div 2} = \\frac{6}{9}", "= \\frac{6 \\div 3}{9 \\div 3} = \\frac{2}{3}.", "\\]", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{求一个量的几分之几}", "", "\\begin{method}[求一个量的几分之几]\\label{met:g6:fractions:ofquantity}", "求一个量的 $\\frac ab$ 时，先将该量除以 $b$（得到一份的大小），", "再乘以 $a$（即取的份数）：", "\\[", "\\frac ab \\text{ 的 } Q = (Q \\div b) \\times a .", "\\]", "（先乘以 $a$ 再除以 $b$，所得结果相同，", "选择便于计算的顺序即可。）", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g6:fractions:ofquantity}", "计算 $\\frac35$ 的 $40$ 欧元是多少，分步进行：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $40$ 的五分之一：$40 \\div 5 = 8$；", "  \\item 五分之三：$8 \\times 3 = 24$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "因此 $\\frac35$ 的 $40$ 欧元是 $24$ 欧元。验算：剩下的", "$\\frac25$ 为 $16$ 欧元，而 $24 + 16 = 40$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g6:fractions:1}", "根据下列图形描述，写出对应的分数：一块蛋糕切成 $8$ 块，", "吃掉 $3$ 块；一块巧克力共 $12$ 格，吃掉 $7$ 格；一个派", "切成 $6$ 块，$6$ 块全部吃掉。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g6:fractions:2}", "画一条长条，平均分成 $5$ 份，并涂出其中的 $\\frac45$，", "判断 $\\frac45$ 比 $1$ 小还是大？$\\frac65$ 呢？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g6:fractions:3}", "在按三分之一刻度的数轴上标出：$\\frac13$；\\ $\\frac53$；", "\\ $2$；\\ $\\frac73$。这些数中，哪两个到", "$2$ 的距离相等？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g6:fractions:4}", "将每个分数写成一个整数与一个小于 $1$ 的分数的和", "（如 $\\frac74 = 1 + \\frac34$）：", "\\[", "\\frac{9}{4}, \\qquad \\frac{13}{5}, \\qquad \\frac{12}{6}, \\qquad", "\\frac{25}{8} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g6:fractions:5}", "填空，使下列分数相等：", "\\[", "\\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{?}{12}, \\qquad", "\\frac{15}{20} = \\frac{3}{?}, \\qquad", "\\frac{7}{10} = \\frac{21}{?}, \\qquad", "\\frac{?}{6} = \\frac{10}{12}.", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g6:fractions:6}", "将下列分数化为最简形式：$\\dfrac{6}{8}$；\\quad $\\dfrac{15}{25}$；", "\\quad $\\dfrac{18}{24}$；\\quad $\\dfrac{35}{7}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g6:fractions:7}", "计算：$\\frac12$ 的 $86$；\\quad $\\frac34$ 的 $60$；\\quad $\\frac25$ 的", "$35$；\\quad $\\frac{7}{10}$ 的 $250$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g6:fractions:8}", "哪个更大：$\\frac12$ 还是 $\\frac13$（同一块蛋糕的）？$\\frac25$", "还是 $\\frac35$？$\\frac34$ 还是 $\\frac78$（将两者都化为分母为", "$8$ 的分数）？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}